content.text:
The incident has one fault that reaches users: search's outgoing calls to rate are held for about 1.5–3 s before rate receives them, which pushes `/hotels` to about 2.9 s at frontend. The geo memory jump is real but has no effect on any caller, so I am not naming it.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "search",
      "fault_kind": "http_slow",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration,0.5)/1e6 p50ms, approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='search' AND span_name='rate.Rate/GetRates' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "search's client calls to rate.Rate/GetRates take p50 about 1,523 ms and p95 about 2,908 ms during the incident."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95ms FROM normal_traces WHERE service_name='search' AND span_name='rate.Rate/GetRates' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "In the normal period the same search→rate client span had p95 about 1.2 ms."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='rate' AND span_name='rate.Rate/GetRates' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "rate's own server span stays around 1.3 ms p95, so the wait is before rate handles the request."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='search' AND span_name='geo.Geo/Nearby' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "search's calls to geo stay fast (about 0.7 ms p95), so only the rate path is affected."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {"from": "search", "to": "frontend", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE (service_name='frontend' AND span_name='HTTP /hotels') OR (service_name='search' AND span_name='search.Search/Nearby') GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "frontend's HTTP /hotels p95 rises to about 2,908 ms, matching search.Search/Nearby p95 of about 2,908 ms."}]}
  ]
}
```

